00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.620
The featured comment comes from Arjan Marku who asked:

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.520
Can we generate electricity if we pass light through a coil?

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:47.620
Well, yeah.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.460
That’s how a receiving antenna works.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:54.100
Long straight conductors for the electric field and a circular coil for the magnetic field.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:57.360
It just isn’t enough current to do much other than receive a signal though.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.980
Anyway, thanks for watching!

